.SH "نام (NAME)"
ostree-admin-stateroot-init \- Initialize empty state for a given operating system
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.HP \w'\fBostree\ admin\ stateroot\-init\fR\ 'u
\fBostree admin stateroot\-init\fR {STATEROOT}
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.PP
Initializes an new stateroot (AKA "osname") for an operating system\&. Ensures that the core subdirectories of /var (/tmp, /lib, /run, and /lock) exist and initialize the given STATEROOT as OSTree stateroot\&. Each deployment location is comprised of a single shared
var
and a set of deployments (chroots)\&.
.SH "مثال (EXAMPLE)"
.PP
\fB$ ostree admin stateroot\-init exampleos\fR
.sp
.if n \{\
.RS 4
.\}
.nf
        ostree/deploy/exampleos initialized as OSTree stateroot
    
.fi
.if n \{\
.RE
.\}
